Start with Default then Apply: 28 psi front / 23 psi rear, 30 L. Use second and third for linked drifts and keep the naturally aspirated engine in its upper rev range. Slow-roll both steering locks before driving; check wheels, body clearance and cockpit hands. Front/rear ARBs, slow dampers, tyre pressures/alignment and LSD settings retain bounded adjustment. Springs and steering ratio are fixed in this first tune. The three exterior slots provide left/right body views and a fixed rear action camera; cockpit, dash and far chase remain native. Driving feel, customization, camera framing, damage and mirror smoke are user checks.
